1
00:00:13,054 --> 00:00:16,433
Ranma of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts.

2
00:00:16,516 --> 00:00:17,642
Oh, yeah!

3
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:21,187
- Win.
- Oh, yeah!

4
00:00:21,896 --> 00:00:25,191
From Tendo Dojo, Akane Tendo.

5
00:00:28,403 --> 00:00:30,196
- Win.
- That was easy!

6
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:33,324
These two teens were arranged
to be married by their parents.

7
00:00:34,325 --> 00:00:35,702
You're not the boss of me.

8
00:00:35,785 --> 00:00:36,786
How annoying!

9
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:39,706
But Ranma suffers
with a small problem.

10
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:44,002
Whenever he's splashed with cold water,
he transforms into a girl.

11
00:00:45,712 --> 00:00:49,966
NEW GAME - CONTINUE

12
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:58,558
RANMA1/2

13
00:02:20,014 --> 00:02:21,432
THE HUNTER

14
00:02:21,516 --> 00:02:23,143
There is a wild boar!

15
00:02:23,226 --> 00:02:25,770
Huge boar coming this way!

16
00:02:28,314 --> 00:02:29,941
Here.

17
00:02:31,484 --> 00:02:33,153
Help me! Help!

18
00:02:34,529 --> 00:02:36,239
- Huh?
- Hey, look out!

19
00:02:36,322 --> 00:02:39,033
It's coming! Run away!

20
00:02:46,666 --> 00:02:50,044
He stopped that boar in its tracks
with just a single hand.

21
00:03:05,393 --> 00:03:07,520
Whoa.

22
00:03:07,604 --> 00:03:10,648
Wow.
This fella's something else.

23
00:03:10,732 --> 00:03:11,733
Incredible.

24
00:03:11,816 --> 00:03:13,568
- Are you a martial artist?
- Amazing.

25
00:03:13,651 --> 00:03:15,862
Have you been holing up
in the mountains to train?

26
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:18,948
I'm trying to find Furinkan High School.

27
00:03:19,032 --> 00:03:20,742
Furinkan High School you say?

28
00:03:21,451 --> 00:03:23,745
Oh. Let me take a look at your map there.

29
00:03:23,828 --> 00:03:25,246
Huh. Hmm?

30
00:03:25,330 --> 00:03:28,666
Hmm. Wait, isn't this a map of Tokyo?

31
00:03:29,167 --> 00:03:31,920
This is Shikoku, friend. Yeah.

32
00:03:32,003 --> 00:03:34,589
Is that right? Then, I'll be off.

33
00:03:39,010 --> 00:03:40,345
He must be lost.

34
00:03:40,845 --> 00:03:44,724
Ranma Saotome, I'm coming to find you.

35
00:03:44,807 --> 00:03:45,892
NO ENTRY FOR LOST TRAVELERS

36
00:03:45,975 --> 00:03:47,644
It's time to fight this out man-to-man.

37
00:03:47,727 --> 00:03:50,230
You should know better
than to try and hide from me!

38
00:03:54,275 --> 00:03:55,693
ANYTHING GOES MARTIAL ARTS
TENDO DOJO

39
00:03:55,777 --> 00:03:57,403
Ranma, please. You have to wait.

40
00:03:57,487 --> 00:03:59,489
No way, absolutely not.

41
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,908
Give it up already.

42
00:04:06,788 --> 00:04:09,207
There's no way you're gonna put me
in girls' clothes.

43
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:13,211
But all of your clothing is still
in the laundry right now, Ranma.

44
00:04:13,294 --> 00:04:15,088
And the bath is almost ready.

45
00:04:15,171 --> 00:04:17,674
You can't wander all over the house
with your business out.

46
00:04:18,258 --> 00:04:20,802
- Come on!
- You're a guest here. Got it?

47
00:04:21,928 --> 00:04:26,724
Okay, but remind me why
it has to be my clothes that he puts on.

48
00:04:26,808 --> 00:04:30,061
I'm not gonna wear a skirt,
so don't even bother asking.

49
00:04:30,144 --> 00:04:31,896
You don't even know
what we're gonna give you.

50
00:04:31,980 --> 00:04:33,690
Oh, okay, how about these?

51
00:04:38,736 --> 00:04:41,322
Mm-hmm. That looks cute on you.

52
00:04:41,406 --> 00:04:42,907
Wow, that's perfect.

53
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:47,078
You sure about that? 'Cause it's kinda
feeling a little tight on the boobies.

54
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:49,163
Really? What about the waist?

55
00:04:49,247 --> 00:04:50,290
Sorta baggy.

56
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,376
All right, Ranma!

57
00:04:53,459 --> 00:04:56,087
You stop it.
Two young ladies should not be fighting.

58
00:04:56,170 --> 00:04:58,047
Well, too bad. I'm a guy!

59
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,384
Do you know
where Furinkan High School is?

60
00:05:02,343 --> 00:05:04,429
You've come all the way out to Hokkaido.

61
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:09,309
ONE WEEK LATER

62
00:05:14,397 --> 00:05:16,566
- Look.
- Huh?

63
00:05:16,649 --> 00:05:19,152
Well, that's weird.
What's up with that guy?

64
00:05:20,862 --> 00:05:22,405
You there.

65
00:05:22,488 --> 00:05:24,073
What do you want?

66
00:05:25,491 --> 00:05:27,994
Do you know where Furinkan High School is?

67
00:05:28,077 --> 00:05:29,078
Huh?

68
00:05:29,162 --> 00:05:32,623
FURINKAN HIGH SCHOOL

69
00:05:32,707 --> 00:05:34,250
Hmm?

70
00:05:38,296 --> 00:05:40,256
Where can I find Ranma Saotome?

71
00:05:40,965 --> 00:05:42,592
Oh. Over there.

72
00:05:43,092 --> 00:05:44,927
Ranma, wait for me.

73
00:05:45,511 --> 00:05:47,972
Kasumi asked us
to go shopping, remember?

74
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:50,099
And why do I have to go with you?

75
00:05:50,183 --> 00:05:52,477
'Cause you have to help me
carry back rice and miso.

76
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:56,105
What's the matter? I thought you'd want
to prove how stupid strong you are.

77
00:05:56,189 --> 00:05:58,066
What did you say to me?

78
00:05:58,149 --> 00:06:00,401
Gonna have to catch me first!

79
00:06:02,195 --> 00:06:03,696
Hmm? Bloodlust?

80
00:06:04,697 --> 00:06:07,575
Ranma, get ready!

81
00:06:09,494 --> 00:06:11,746
- Huh?
- Whoa.

82
00:06:15,583 --> 00:06:16,709
Hmm?

83
00:06:18,878 --> 00:06:20,713
What gives?

84
00:06:21,464 --> 00:06:23,966
Running away just like you always do, huh?

85
00:06:24,050 --> 00:06:25,051
Ranma.

86
00:06:25,885 --> 00:06:27,220
Do you know him?

87
00:06:27,303 --> 00:06:28,304
Mmm?

88
00:06:29,389 --> 00:06:30,807
- Hmm.
- Hmm?

89
00:06:32,141 --> 00:06:33,393
Mm-hmm.

90
00:06:36,813 --> 00:06:40,483
Oh, yeah! You're, uh... the, uh...

91
00:06:40,566 --> 00:06:42,402
Uh.

92
00:06:42,485 --> 00:06:44,487
That brain's really working overtime, huh?

93
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,947
You're...

94
00:06:46,030 --> 00:06:48,408
Allow me to ask one thing, Ranma.

95
00:06:48,950 --> 00:06:51,911
Why did you no-show
when it came time for us to fight?

96
00:06:51,994 --> 00:06:54,414
Oh! I remember now.

97
00:06:54,497 --> 00:06:57,333
I think you and I used to go
to the same school before.

98
00:06:57,917 --> 00:06:59,377
Ryoga Hibiki!

99
00:06:59,919 --> 00:07:01,087
How you doing, man?

100
00:07:01,170 --> 00:07:03,297
You will answer the question!

101
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,592
I waited around for you
at the spot we were supposed to meet

102
00:07:06,676 --> 00:07:08,177
for, like, three days, bro.

103
00:07:08,261 --> 00:07:09,387
Three days?

104
00:07:09,470 --> 00:07:10,763
Yes.

105
00:07:10,847 --> 00:07:14,142
But when I was finally able
to make it there on day four,

106
00:07:14,225 --> 00:07:16,519
I looked and you were nowhere to be found.

107
00:07:17,437 --> 00:07:20,898
All right then. I want to ask you
a question too, Ryoga.

108
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:22,775
RYOGA'S HOUSE - EMPTY LOT
FOR FIGHT - RANMA'S HOUSE

109
00:07:22,859 --> 00:07:25,153
Could you tell me how it took you
four whole days to get there?

110
00:07:25,236 --> 00:07:26,362
You shut your mouth!

111
00:07:26,446 --> 00:07:29,240
Do you think I was spending
those four days of my life

112
00:07:29,323 --> 00:07:31,117
gaily skipping all over the place?

113
00:07:31,701 --> 00:07:34,078
Aw, son, this is Enoshima.

114
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:35,913
You're in Harajuku, man.

115
00:07:36,747 --> 00:07:39,250
Are you an idiot? This is Asakusa.

116
00:07:39,333 --> 00:07:43,588
Do you have any real idea
of what I had to overcome to get here?

117
00:07:44,505 --> 00:07:46,132
A crappy sense of direction?

118
00:07:46,215 --> 00:07:47,717
That's what it looks like to me.

119
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,761
Mm-hmm. Yeah, his direction is pretty bad.

120
00:07:50,845 --> 00:07:53,222
You've broken
a gentleman's agreement.

121
00:07:53,306 --> 00:07:57,268
And then you ran away with your dad
to cower in China!

122
00:07:58,728 --> 00:08:00,938
Let's get to the point.

123
00:08:01,022 --> 00:08:03,274
You want to try and find a way
to settle this.

124
00:08:03,357 --> 00:08:04,817
To settle this?

125
00:08:04,901 --> 00:08:06,235
Not even close.

126
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:08,946
I'm here to get revenge!

127
00:08:09,947 --> 00:08:10,907
Oh.

128
00:08:13,993 --> 00:08:16,078
Hmm?

129
00:08:19,499 --> 00:08:21,834
I don't even care what the cost is to me.

130
00:08:21,918 --> 00:08:24,420
I'll do anything it takes
to wipe out your joy.

131
00:08:28,174 --> 00:08:29,634
CHALLENGE

132
00:08:29,717 --> 00:08:30,927
A letter of challenge?

133
00:08:31,010 --> 00:08:32,470
I've made it official.

134
00:08:33,221 --> 00:08:35,097
Don't run away from me this time.

135
00:08:38,893 --> 00:08:40,645
That guy really hates me.

136
00:08:45,483 --> 00:08:48,027
Huh? Am I happy about anything?

137
00:08:48,528 --> 00:08:50,446
How am I supposed to know if you're happy?

138
00:09:00,581 --> 00:09:03,626
Ranma, I'll find a way
to get my revenge.

139
00:09:04,669 --> 00:09:09,549
My life has gotten so far past the point
of messed up and it's all your fault.

140
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:15,096
Just like this fragile walnut...

141
00:09:16,264 --> 00:09:19,433
...I'll take your windpipe
into my hands.

142
00:09:19,517 --> 00:09:21,102
And crush it!

143
00:09:21,185 --> 00:09:22,979
Ready yourself, Ranma!

144
00:09:23,813 --> 00:09:25,523
So he's challenging you, huh?

145
00:09:26,482 --> 00:09:29,151
What did you do
to make him want to fight you so bad?

146
00:09:29,235 --> 00:09:30,861
That's a good question.

147
00:09:31,737 --> 00:09:32,947
Hmm.

148
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:34,907
Oh, where are my keys?

149
00:09:34,991 --> 00:09:37,076
- Hang on to this for me.
- Hmm?

150
00:09:42,873 --> 00:09:44,250
We're back.

151
00:09:44,333 --> 00:09:47,044
We got the stuff.

152
00:09:47,128 --> 00:09:48,170
A FEW DAYS LATER

153
00:09:48,254 --> 00:09:50,047
Thanks for making food!

154
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:52,508
Uh.

155
00:09:53,092 --> 00:09:54,427
You ass!

156
00:09:54,510 --> 00:09:56,095
Fork over the sausage!

157
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:58,264
Can't you let us eat our breakfast
in peace?

158
00:09:58,347 --> 00:10:00,558
- Animal! Just stick to bamboo!
- Oh, Ranma.

159
00:10:00,641 --> 00:10:04,145
I think you left this on top of the miso.

160
00:10:04,228 --> 00:10:05,938
Oh. Oh, I did?

161
00:10:06,939 --> 00:10:09,734
Sorry, you were challenged
to a duel. Again?

162
00:10:10,318 --> 00:10:12,403
What did you do this time?

163
00:10:12,903 --> 00:10:14,947
That's the thing. I can't remember.

164
00:10:15,031 --> 00:10:16,490
It must be bad, right?

165
00:10:16,574 --> 00:10:19,327
It can't have been just anything.
He was really angry.

166
00:10:20,036 --> 00:10:21,912
- Oh!
- You figured it out?

167
00:10:21,996 --> 00:10:24,040
Here we go. It's all coming back to you.

168
00:10:24,957 --> 00:10:27,710
I think something happened
at the beginning of the semester.

169
00:10:33,966 --> 00:10:35,760
Time for lunch, boys!

170
00:10:35,843 --> 00:10:36,844
CAFETERIA

171
00:10:36,927 --> 00:10:39,388
Hurry up!
What food have you got? Please!

172
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:42,975
Okay! I got the last curry bun we have
right here.

173
00:10:44,477 --> 00:10:45,978
Come here!

174
00:10:51,067 --> 00:10:53,653
Next, we got
lots of red bean buns here!

175
00:10:53,736 --> 00:10:55,237
Who wants a red bean bun?

176
00:10:55,321 --> 00:10:57,948
You cad. What is it they call you?

177
00:10:58,532 --> 00:11:02,119
Hmm? Ranma Saotome.

178
00:11:02,203 --> 00:11:07,291
Ranma Saotome.
My curry bun grudge will never die!

179
00:11:08,751 --> 00:11:11,504
I'm pretty sure he was crying
from how frustrated he was.

180
00:11:12,004 --> 00:11:14,465
I mean, lunchtime was
always kind of a war zone.

181
00:11:14,548 --> 00:11:15,925
It was an all-boys' school.

182
00:11:16,008 --> 00:11:17,259
- Boys' school?
- Boys' school?

183
00:11:17,343 --> 00:11:19,679
Back then, I was a boy
a hundred percent of the time!

184
00:11:19,762 --> 00:11:21,180
Every single day of the year!

185
00:11:21,889 --> 00:11:24,892
Okay. But all of this
over one curry bun?

186
00:11:25,476 --> 00:11:26,769
I know, right?

187
00:11:27,353 --> 00:11:29,522
If that's all...

188
00:11:31,107 --> 00:11:33,150
Hmm. Oh!

189
00:11:33,734 --> 00:11:37,363
All right, you animals.
Here comes the last yakisoba bun!

190
00:11:38,948 --> 00:11:40,700
I guess it was more than once.

191
00:11:40,783 --> 00:11:42,827
Heads up!
Here's the last croquette bun!

192
00:11:43,703 --> 00:11:44,620
Or maybe when--

193
00:11:44,704 --> 00:11:45,996
Melon buns!

194
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,373
Katsu sandwich!

195
00:11:47,456 --> 00:11:48,749
Meat bun!

196
00:11:48,833 --> 00:11:51,627
Oh, and I guess there was
also the seaweed bun.

197
00:11:51,711 --> 00:11:52,837
Hmm.

198
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:55,589
So it was
a lot of little things that piled up.

199
00:11:58,426 --> 00:11:59,927
Hmm?

200
00:12:00,010 --> 00:12:02,930
Hang on, Ranma.
The date of the challenge was yesterday.

201
00:12:03,013 --> 00:12:05,057
Huh? I wouldn't worry about it.

202
00:12:05,141 --> 00:12:07,393
That guy has no sense of direction at all.

203
00:12:07,476 --> 00:12:09,228
I betcha he's lost right now.

204
00:12:09,854 --> 00:12:11,480
It's this way to Tokyo, right?

205
00:12:11,564 --> 00:12:13,691
No, I just told you it's this way.

206
00:12:13,774 --> 00:12:15,818
What possessed you to go that way?

207
00:12:16,652 --> 00:12:19,780
Just you wait, Ranma Saotome.

208
00:12:22,992 --> 00:12:23,993
ONE WEEK LATER

209
00:12:24,076 --> 00:12:26,245
It's time for the season
with crystal-clear skies

210
00:12:26,328 --> 00:12:27,580
and light, pleasant breezes.

211
00:12:27,663 --> 00:12:30,082
Hello to all you
Furinkan High School students.

212
00:12:30,750 --> 00:12:32,752
We've all been gathered at school field 2,

213
00:12:32,835 --> 00:12:36,088
where Ranma Saotome of the Saotome School
of Anything Goes Martial Arts

214
00:12:36,172 --> 00:12:39,925
is about to face off against a mysterious
stranger claiming to be a student.

215
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:41,218
We haven't even started,

216
00:12:41,302 --> 00:12:43,721
but the glares on their faces
have been fierce.

217
00:12:43,804 --> 00:12:46,682
It evokes images of historic fights
like Ganryujima.

218
00:12:46,766 --> 00:12:49,143
- What fate will befall our challengers?
- Shut up!

219
00:12:49,226 --> 00:12:51,937
All we can do is hold our breath
and wait to see what will happen.

220
00:12:52,021 --> 00:12:54,273
You're currently listening
to live commentary

221
00:12:54,356 --> 00:12:57,985
brought to you by the Radio Club,
produced and narrated by me, Ichiro.

222
00:12:59,528 --> 00:13:03,574
Ranma. I see you didn't run away
like a coward this time.

223
00:13:03,657 --> 00:13:07,286
Easy there, Ryoga. I didn't come here
'cause I wanted to fight you.

224
00:13:08,621 --> 00:13:09,705
I got you these.

225
00:13:11,499 --> 00:13:12,500
CURRY BUN

226
00:13:12,583 --> 00:13:13,793
What on earth...

227
00:13:13,876 --> 00:13:17,213
So we good?
It's all just water under the bridge now.

228
00:13:17,296 --> 00:13:19,173
Enough with the jokes!

229
00:13:19,256 --> 00:13:21,634
Man, you're just getting greedy now.

230
00:13:23,177 --> 00:13:24,220
Here you go.

231
00:13:26,055 --> 00:13:27,598
Yakisoba bun!

232
00:13:29,350 --> 00:13:33,062
Here's a croquette bun,
a melon bun and a katsu sandwich.

233
00:13:33,145 --> 00:13:35,523
A meat bun and...
...a seaweed bun.

234
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:37,107
How's that?

235
00:13:37,191 --> 00:13:39,193
I don't think I forgot anything, did I?

236
00:13:42,530 --> 00:13:45,658
What kind of game are you playing
with me, you bastard?

237
00:13:46,492 --> 00:13:48,828
I thought this was
'cause you were mad about your buns.

238
00:13:48,911 --> 00:13:51,580
Who in the world would fight over buns?

239
00:13:52,414 --> 00:13:54,959
- Oh.
- Why bother spending money on these

240
00:13:55,042 --> 00:13:57,628
if they're all gonna be
past their expiration date?

241
00:13:57,711 --> 00:14:00,381
Well, yeah, 'cause I had to wait
for you to show up for a week.

242
00:14:00,464 --> 00:14:02,633
Enough. Let's go!

243
00:14:04,176 --> 00:14:05,427
Uh.

244
00:14:05,511 --> 00:14:06,887
Chill out a sec.

245
00:14:09,139 --> 00:14:11,225
Just tell me why first.

246
00:14:11,308 --> 00:14:14,728
I had to make my way through hell
and it's all your fault!

247
00:14:18,607 --> 00:14:20,860
Yeah, I still don't get it.

248
00:14:20,943 --> 00:14:22,820
- Hmm.
- No, of course you don't.

249
00:14:22,903 --> 00:14:27,491
And even if I did try tell you the reason,
you wouldn't believe me to begin with.

250
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:29,159
Mmm?

251
00:14:31,579 --> 00:14:33,497
Hmm? Hmm?

252
00:14:34,665 --> 00:14:35,666
Mmm.

253
00:14:35,749 --> 00:14:39,044
You won't be able to scurry away
from me now, Ranma!

254
00:14:39,879 --> 00:14:41,297
Ryoga.

255
00:14:41,380 --> 00:14:42,673
How...

256
00:14:43,841 --> 00:14:45,467
How many bandanas are you wearing?

257
00:14:46,051 --> 00:14:48,220
That's the question
you wanna ask right now?

258
00:14:48,304 --> 00:14:49,889
He can't get away now!

259
00:14:49,972 --> 00:14:52,141
This match looks
like it's gonna be a close one.

260
00:15:01,317 --> 00:15:02,735
Why is this thing so heavy?

261
00:15:02,818 --> 00:15:05,988
I don't think I could lift it.

262
00:15:06,071 --> 00:15:07,656
Let me try.

263
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:10,159
I'm pretty sure
that thing made me throw my back out.

264
00:15:10,242 --> 00:15:13,454
How can he
just throw around something this heavy?

265
00:15:14,413 --> 00:15:16,624
He's on a
whole different level than Ranma.

266
00:15:16,707 --> 00:15:18,584
How are you feeling right now?

267
00:15:18,667 --> 00:15:21,837
Ranma, wait! You need
more space between you!

268
00:15:21,921 --> 00:15:24,715
It won't end well if he lands a hit!

269
00:15:24,798 --> 00:15:26,592
Huh?

270
00:15:27,593 --> 00:15:28,594
Ha!

271
00:15:30,137 --> 00:15:31,639
Okay.

272
00:15:33,015 --> 00:15:35,684
Let's see what happens
when I make you bring your A-game.

273
00:15:35,768 --> 00:15:40,189
Ranma! This guy's no joke.
His arms are monsters!

274
00:15:41,398 --> 00:15:44,109
It took you this long to figure it out.

275
00:15:53,202 --> 00:15:55,996
So, Ryoga? How you wanna handle this?

276
00:15:57,623 --> 00:15:59,458
Do you think this is a joke?

277
00:16:00,084 --> 00:16:03,337
- I refuse to crawl...
- Mm-hmm.

278
00:16:03,420 --> 00:16:05,130
...on all fours

279
00:16:05,673 --> 00:16:08,968
...like a dog!

280
00:16:10,594 --> 00:16:13,013
A one-armed spring into the air!

281
00:16:13,097 --> 00:16:14,473
Whoa, there!

282
00:16:22,481 --> 00:16:24,483
He's coming this way!

283
00:16:32,491 --> 00:16:34,743
- Take this!
-!

284
00:16:35,494 --> 00:16:36,954
Huh?

285
00:16:38,998 --> 00:16:41,375
You didn't have to destroy
my favorite shirt.

286
00:16:41,458 --> 00:16:45,713
I don't want to waste time talking about
girlie stuff in the middle of a fight!

287
00:16:46,255 --> 00:16:49,967
Who says
liking clothes is girlie?

288
00:16:50,050 --> 00:16:51,927
Ryoga!

289
00:16:52,011 --> 00:16:54,888
- He's jumped over the fence!
- Follow him!

290
00:16:56,890 --> 00:16:58,308
I want you to take it back.

291
00:16:58,392 --> 00:17:01,145
Take it back now!

292
00:17:02,104 --> 00:17:03,063
Whoa!

293
00:17:03,147 --> 00:17:06,859
What just happened? A pillar of water has
sprung up like a geyser.

294
00:17:06,942 --> 00:17:08,152
Ranma.

295
00:17:20,789 --> 00:17:21,790
Let's go!

296
00:17:21,874 --> 00:17:24,251
Huh? Wha... Wait a mi--

297
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,545
Where did you come from?

298
00:17:26,628 --> 00:17:28,589
Come on! Get your head back in the game!

299
00:17:35,262 --> 00:17:36,805
Wha... Ranma?

300
00:17:36,889 --> 00:17:40,184
Who else could I possibly be,
you stupid idiot?

301
00:17:40,768 --> 00:17:42,394
Careful, Ranma. Your chest!

302
00:17:42,478 --> 00:17:43,479
Huh?

303
00:17:45,564 --> 00:17:48,942
Did you really not notice
that you'd turned into a girl?

304
00:17:49,860 --> 00:17:52,154
R-Ranma. So then you're...

305
00:17:56,200 --> 00:17:59,203
Go ahead and laugh
if you think it's so funny.

306
00:18:00,370 --> 00:18:03,457
I have no idea what I could've done
that made you hate me so much.

307
00:18:04,625 --> 00:18:06,210
But I'm trying.

308
00:18:06,293 --> 00:18:10,339
Whatever this body does, I just want
to live a happy and honest life.

309
00:18:10,422 --> 00:18:11,423
Hmm.

310
00:18:14,051 --> 00:18:15,511
Oh. Huh?

311
00:18:16,762 --> 00:18:17,763
Ha!

312
00:18:18,263 --> 00:18:21,308
Is this really
all that there is to your misery?

313
00:18:21,391 --> 00:18:24,228
Especially when you look
as cute as you do.

314
00:18:26,230 --> 00:18:29,191
You believe
your tale of woe will dissuade me?

315
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:32,986
Don't make me laugh!

316
00:18:33,570 --> 00:18:36,782
Uh-oh. We're seeing the beginnings
of a fierce battle ahead.

317
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:39,451
Wha... Something is flying this way!

318
00:18:39,535 --> 00:18:42,162
Is it a bird? Or a plane?
No, it's a bandana!

319
00:18:43,413 --> 00:18:45,290
I'll go get hot water.

320
00:18:45,374 --> 00:18:47,292
You idiot. You'll get yourself hurt.

321
00:18:47,376 --> 00:18:48,210
I'll be okay.

322
00:18:52,881 --> 00:18:53,924
You're open!

323
00:18:55,259 --> 00:18:58,470
What will you do now?
Even if you dodge the umbrella,

324
00:18:58,554 --> 00:19:01,640
I'll use these bandanas
to attack you from every direction!

325
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:07,855
Okay, hold on tight. Ready?

326
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:12,860
The skill!

327
00:19:12,943 --> 00:19:14,611
Even while holding such heavy weapons,

328
00:19:14,695 --> 00:19:16,822
the combatants are leaping in the air
like dancers!

329
00:19:16,905 --> 00:19:18,907
Running away, you coward?

330
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:20,784
Uh, just give me a second.

331
00:19:35,424 --> 00:19:36,842
Uh...

332
00:19:48,604 --> 00:19:49,730
- Nice job!
- That was ju--

333
00:19:51,190 --> 00:19:52,816
Uh, what's going on?

334
00:19:53,442 --> 00:19:54,443
What do you mean?

335
00:19:54,943 --> 00:19:58,947
This is all your fault, you know.
Nobody asked you to get involved.

336
00:19:59,031 --> 00:20:01,867
Oh, yeah? Well there's no way
you would've beat him as a girl.

337
00:20:01,950 --> 00:20:04,328
- You know that.
- That's a pretty messed-up thing to say.

338
00:20:04,411 --> 00:20:07,289
This battle was supposed to be
a man-to-man before you poked in.

339
00:20:07,372 --> 00:20:08,749
How exactly are you a man?

340
00:20:08,832 --> 00:20:11,251
Oh, look. What could he be doing now?

341
00:20:11,335 --> 00:20:13,128
- ...work this out for you.
- Huh?

342
00:20:13,212 --> 00:20:14,463
Ah, just shut up!

343
00:20:14,546 --> 00:20:15,672
You always do this.

344
00:20:15,756 --> 00:20:17,799
It's like you need to stick your nose
in other people's--

345
00:20:17,883 --> 00:20:19,468
If you were a little more cautious--

346
00:20:27,226 --> 00:20:28,769
Let me go.

347
00:20:28,852 --> 00:20:30,062
Are you serious?

348
00:20:30,145 --> 00:20:32,105
I'm not holding you
because I like it, idiot.

349
00:20:36,652 --> 00:20:37,819
Oh.

350
00:20:41,156 --> 00:20:43,867
If my worrying about you is gonna be
that annoying,

351
00:20:43,951 --> 00:20:44,993
fine, then.

352
00:20:50,874 --> 00:20:52,000
Akane.

353
00:20:52,084 --> 00:20:53,877
We're not finished yet!

354
00:20:53,961 --> 00:20:56,171
Shut up!

355
00:20:58,799 --> 00:20:59,967
Akane.

356
00:21:01,551 --> 00:21:03,512
Uh... Um...

357
00:21:05,264 --> 00:21:06,473
I don't care.

358
00:21:07,474 --> 00:21:11,228
From now on, I don't want to have
anything to do with you anymore.

359
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:25,158
Uh...
